{
  "hooks": {
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "matcher": "",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "prompt",
            "prompt": "Pipeline Orchestrator v8.9.0 loaded. Entry points: /pipeline-orchestrator:pipeline (full classifier, supports --light/--heavy variant flags), /pipeline-orchestrator:bugfix [task] (auto-classify or --light/--heavy), /pipeline-orchestrator:bugfix-light [task] and /pipeline-orchestrator:bugfix-heavy [task] (Slice 1.5 — 2 separate skills), /pipeline-orchestrator:audit [scope] (auto-classify or --light/--heavy), /pipeline-orchestrator:audit-light [scope] and /pipeline-orchestrator:audit-heavy [scope] (Slice 3a — REPORT ONLY by Iron Law), /pipeline-orchestrator:feature [task] (thin shortcut, auto-classify or --light/--heavy), /pipeline-orchestrator:feature-light [task] and /pipeline-orchestrator:feature-heavy [task] (Slice 3b — 2 separate skills mirroring Pulsar Ligth/ + Heavy/ folders 1:1, declarative contract via frontmatter). All entry-points manual-only via disable-model-invocation:true. v4.8.0 (Hook Enforcement): SKILL.md frontmatter contracts (sentinel_checkpoints, agent_type, gates_at) now enforced by hooks — warn mode until 2026-05-17, deny mode after. Override via env PIPELINE_ENFORCEMENT={warn,deny}. v4.7.0 (Slice 3b polish): full frontmatter contract on 26 step files + complete SKILL.md manifests + thin /feature entry-point + real workflow tests. v4.6.1 (Slice 3b correction): reverted unified single-skill pattern to 2 separate skills per Pulsar canonical structure. v4.5.0 (Slice 3a): audit import. v4.4.x: bugfix import + exec-window wrapper."
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/.claude/hooks/cleanup-orphan-sentinel-state-hook.cjs\""
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "UserPromptSubmit": [
      {
        "matcher": "",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/.claude/hooks/force-pipeline-agents.cjs\""
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/.claude/hooks/session-lock-hook.cjs\""
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/.claude/hooks/pipeline-arm-writer.cjs\""
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "Stop": [
      {
        "matcher": "",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/.claude/hooks/completion-checklist.cjs\""
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/.claude/hooks/session-cleanup-hook.cjs\""
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/.claude/hooks/stop-hook.cjs\""
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PostToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Agent",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/.claude/hooks/langfuse-hook.cjs\""
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/.claude/hooks/step-ledger-stamp.cjs\""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "AskUserQuestion",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/.claude/hooks/human-gate-record.cjs\""
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Agent",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/.claude/hooks/sentinel-hook.cjs\""
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/.claude/hooks/langfuse-hook.cjs\""
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/.claude/hooks/parallel-dispatch-gate.cjs\""
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/.claude/hooks/step-ledger-gate.cjs\""
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/.claude/hooks/gate-log-gate.cjs\""
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/.claude/hooks/batch-review-gate.cjs\""
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/.claude/hooks/checkpoint-verdict-gate.cjs\""
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/.claude/hooks/phase-verdict-gate.cjs\""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "Skill|Agent",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/.claude/hooks/dispatch-guard.cjs\""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "Edit|Write|NotebookEdit|MultiEdit",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/.claude/hooks/edit-guard-hook.cjs\""
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/.claude/hooks/scope-lock-hook.cjs\""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": "Bash|PowerShell",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/.claude/hooks/edit-guard-hook.cjs\""
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/.claude/hooks/spec-seal-guard.cjs\""
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "matcher": ".*",
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/.claude/hooks/dispatch-pending-gate.cjs\""
          },
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "node \"${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/.claude/hooks/pipeline-arm-gate.cjs\""
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
